{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Drift Survivors 2&quot; is the sequel to the acclaimed arcade game, now infused with roguelite elements. Upgrade your vehicle in intense battles and choose a gun that matches your style from random weapon drops! The online leaderboard is still there, challenging you to achieve higher scores in Endless Mode and make your mark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Enjoy improved controls, allowing you to drift with ease and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/ff7fa8456f9685b1f8000dd309948aaf.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. While gamepads and keyboards capture the essence of action games, mouse input is also supported for a more accessible experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/9416d112b3e4facfccc4e463fb117ad0.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unlock a variety of vehicles and guns to create your perfect combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. In Normal Mode, enhance your vehicle with attribute upgrade cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stylized pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy-to-learn yet challenging drifting mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Powerful and unique enemies and bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Global leaderboard challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Thrilling collisions, shootings, and explosions!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FIRST BLOOD!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/23209bcf73ae0c7d31ebf5eb80be00a67d5fdfd5.jpg"},{"name":"SCORCHING BARREL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/b24a7219daa24753dc4b4a4da6447b5709863c5c.jpg"},{"name":"ULTIMATE FURY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/8cf160d5850b314092cfab6560f915f2ce03c633.jpg"},{"name":"MACHINE GUN MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/7b503e740c2661b30a6a6454f74971ab8aeaef4c.jpg"},{"name":"CAPTURE THE KING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/8a94cb2683e845c77723bb5e529ead2f3c7a20ea.jpg"},{"name":"BRAND-NEW VEHICLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/c28ee8a4c1623e5ab5d85704e16cdba4b5b1dbb6.jpg"},{"name":"DEATH'S DOOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/47e559085627d700848d56b3f363e5d2d9f8c66b.jpg"},{"name":"INSECT SLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3386100/