t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unlock a variety of vehicles and guns to create your perfect combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/cb7ae19ef2a82270c732930f8bc96c6a.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. In Normal Mode, enhance your vehicle with attribute upgrade cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.poster.avif?t=1773033401\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.webm?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386100/extras/8f1c2f80c85cd4e9c1505391de5a90d5.mp4?t=1773033401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stylized pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy-to-learn yet challenging drifting mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Powerful and unique enemies and bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Global leaderboard challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_